    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_19",
      "hash64": "AA1740EB935D1F69",
      "text": "¡Nuestro objetivo es recaudar 1 000 000 !\\nSi quieres donar un poquito más, aquí estaré.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_20",
      "hash64": "AA13C1EB935A11C5",
      "text": "Mecachis en la mar... Parece que no tienes\\nsuficiente dinero para hacer esa donación.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_21",
      "hash64": "AA13C0EB935A1012",
      "text": "¡Tu donación es más que bienvenida, mocit[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa!\\nAcepta esto como agradecimiento.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_22",
      "hash64": "AA13BFEB935A0E5F",
      "text": "Hasta ahora hemos recaudado [VAR 0x0206(0001,202F)] .\\n¡Cada vez más cerca del millón![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "0206",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001",
            "202F"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_23",
      "hash64": "AA13BEEB935A0CAC",
      "text": "¡No puedo creerlo! Con esta donación...[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_38",
      "hash64": "AA1043EB935705D4",
      "text": "¡Hemos alcanzado el objetivo de recaudar\\n1 000 000 ![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_24",
      "hash64": "AA13BDEB935A0AF9",
      "text": "¡Por fin vamos a poder reconstruir las estatuas\\nde los compatrones![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_25",
      "hash64": "AA13BCEB935A0946",
      "text": "Voy a ponerme en contacto con el especialista\\nde inmediato...\\c\\nTiqui, tiqui... Marco los numeritos y...[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_26",
      "hash64": "AA13BBEB935A0793",
      "text": "¿Hola? Sí, soy yo. Mira, que ya hemos logrado\\nreunir la cantidad de dinero que necesitábamos,\\r\\nasí que te puedes poner a trabajar de inmediato.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_27",
      "hash64": "AA13BAEB935A05E0",
      "text": "¡La obra está terminada! ¿Quieres que vayamos\\na ver cómo ha quedado?[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_28",
      "hash64": "AA13C9EB935A1F5D",
      "text": "Oh... No tengo palabras...[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 4,
